{
  "Npcs.TrainingDummy.Desc": "[dummyname] is a simple training dummy of wood and nails, built by yourself in pursuit of something to practice on. It's a plain dummy, vaguely humanoid, with sticks for arms, ending in a pair of old frying pans, and some wooden plating on its chest, shoulders, and head, where you've also carved a crude face. Despite its ramshackle appearance, it's pretty sturdy, able to withstand most attacks and spells, and will hopefully last you a good while.[pg]Being a dummy, it will naturally not fight back, nor try to evade your attacks."
  "Npcs.TrainingDummy.Desc.Both": "[dummyname] is a simple training dummy of wood and nails, built by yourself in pursuit of something to practice on. Aside from a pair of angular, pyramid-shaped tits jutting from its torso, you additionally gave this dummy a dildo further down below, making it appear like a transsexual. It's vaguely humanoid, with sticks for arms, ending in a pair of old frying pans, and some wooden plating on its chest, shoulders, and head, where you've also carved a crude face. Despite its ramshackle appearance, it's pretty sturdy, able to withstand most attacks and spells, and will hopefully last you a good while.[pg]Being a dummy, it will naturally not fight back, nor try to evade your attacks."
  "Npcs.TrainingDummy.Desc.Dick": "[dummyname] is a simple training dummy of wood and nails, built by yourself in pursuit of something to practice on. You elected to put a dildo onto its crotch, making it look like this dummy is sporting a permanent erection. It's vaguely humanoid, with sticks for arms, ending in a pair of old frying pans, and some wooden plating on its chest, shoulders, and head, where you've also carved a crude face. Despite its ramshackle appearance, it's pretty sturdy, able to withstand most attacks and spells, and will hopefully last you a good while.[pg]Being a dummy, it will naturally not fight back, nor try to evade your attacks."
  "Npcs.TrainingDummy.Desc.Tits": "[dummyname] is a simple training dummy of wood and nails, built by yourself in pursuit of something to practice on. You elected to give it a nice pair of tits, though they are rather pyramid-shaped and angular. It's vaguely humanoid, with sticks for arms, ending in a pair of old frying pans, and some wooden plating on its chest, shoulders, and head, where you've also carved a crude face. Despite its ramshackle appearance, it's pretty sturdy, able to withstand most attacks and spells, and will hopefully last you a good while.[pg]Being a dummy, it will naturally not fight back, nor try to evade your attacks."
  "Npcs.TrainingDummy.Name": "training dummy"
}
